<title>TOGO: SOCCER-TOGO AND ANGOLA DRAW WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-TOGO AND ANGOLA DRAW WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>LOME 1997-08-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of a World Cup soccer African</p>
<p>zone group four qualifier played on Sunday:</p>
<p> Togo   1   Angola    1   (halftime 0-1)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Togo - Ouadga Lantam 47</p>
<p>Angola - Joaquim Silva 44</p>
<p>Attendance: 7,000</p>
<p>    Final standings    P   W   D   L   F   A     Pts</p>
<p> Cameroon		  5   4   1   0   9   3     13</p>
<p> Angola		    5   2   3   0   6   3	9</p>
<p> Zimbabwe		  5   1   1   3   5   5	4</p>
<p> Togo			5   0   1   4   4  13	1</p>
<p>Cameroon qualify for finals.</p>
</text>
